- POST /api/v1/events/{id:guid}/cancel
- GET /api/v1/events
- GET /api/v1/events/{id:guid}
- DELETE /api/v1/events/{id:guid}
- PUT /api/v1/events/{id:guid}
- POST /api/v1/events/{id:guid}/complete
- GET /api/v1/events/{id:guid}/logs
- POST /api/v1/events
Negative: with any one of these waivers removed, Rule A fails naming that route.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Task 160 routes:
- POST /api/dataverse/fetch (S-09) and GET /api/dataverse/record/{entityLogicalName}/{id:guid} (S-10) are flagged, because their DataverseAuthorizationFilter forms are not credited. They carry Pending NoDecision waivers owned by "160".
